        "acfe_flexible_layout_title": "Solutions",
        "add_introduction": true,
        "introduction": {
          "": null,
          "kicker": "Services",
          "kicker_tag": "div",
          "title": "Digital services that engage, perform + deliver",
          "heading_level": "h2",
          "heading_tag": "div",
          "add_description": false,
          "description": ""
        },
        "introduction_link": "",
        "column": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/CRO-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon CRO\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4>CRO + data analytics</h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Marketing and product leaders need measurable solutions to tackle key user pain points and drive engagement. We create data strategies and content frameworks tailored to critical user segments and moments, delivering clear, actionable insights that drive results.</p>\n<h5>CASE STUDY</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/work/caron/\">See how Caron achieved a 56% increase in engagement across key patient touchpoints</a></p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4 style=\"margin-top: 100px;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Platforms-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon platforms\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255 255 255/var(--tw-bg-opacity)); color: rgb(3 3 3/var(--tw-text-opacity));\">Experience platforms</span></h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Managing content effectively across platforms while maintaining strong audience connections is challenging. We craft audience-focused content plans leveraging Industry leading digital experience platforms that simplify workflows and empower your team.</p>\n<h5>CASE STUDY</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/work/vertex/\">See our work enhancing Vertex&#8217;s site with regional content, achieving a 3X increase in key conversion points</a></p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Mktgauto-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon marketing automation\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4>Marketing automation</h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Many organizations struggle to deliver personalized messaging that resonates with users at the right time. By leveraging our expertise and key partnerships, we create marketing automation solutions that deliver the right message to the right audience at the perfect moment.</p>\n<h5>Perspective</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/personalization-creating-an-individualized-journey-for-your-customers\">Explore how AI-driven personalization can revolutionize your marketing automation strategy</a></p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4 style=\"margin-top: 100px;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Digital-products-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon digital products\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4>Digital products</h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Delivering intuitive and efficient digital tools for customers and employees requires thoughtful design systems and continuous improvement. We design and develop custom applications &#8211; from mobile apps to portals &#8211; that simplify lives and enhance experiences.</p>\n<h5>CASE STUDY</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/work/linode/\">Discover how reimagining Linode&#8217;s core product offering led to its $900M acquisition</a></p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/UXUI-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon UX UI\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4>UX + UI design</h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Creating engaging, high-performing experiences that align with your brand and captivate users is no small feat. We use deep user insights and AI-enhanced workflows to design solutions that are both impactful and continuously validated for success.</p>\n<h5>CASE STUDY</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/work/best-egg/\">See how we partnered with Best Egg to design an intuitive UX that effectively meets customer needs</a></p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4 style=\"margin-top: 100px;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-9633\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Accessibility-icon.png\" alt=\"red circle with black icon accessibility\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" /></h4>\n<h4>Accessibility</h4>\n<p class=\"small\">Ensuring digital experiences are accessible to the widest audience isn’t just the right thing to do &#8211; it’s smart business. Our accessibility experts deliver inclusive solutions that add value for all users while enhancing brand equity and meeting compliance standards.</p>\n<h5>Perspective</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/ebook-accessibility-for-pm-teams/\">Explore our e-book, &#8220;Accessibility Considerations,&#8221; to learn the impact of building accessible experiences</a></p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "acf_fc_layout": "multiple_columns",
        "acfe_flexible_toggle": "",
        "acfe_flexible_layout_title": "Partnerships",
        "add_introduction": true,
        "introduction": {
          "": null,
