        "introduction_link": "",
        "column": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9628\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-640x640.jpg\" alt=\"acquia and drupal logos\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-640x640.jpg 640w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-150x150.jpg 150w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-768x768.jpg 768w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-48x48.jpg 48w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/acquia-drupal-1280x1280.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<h4>Acquia + Drupal</h4>\n<p>Managing and scaling digital experiences is challenging without robust, secure, and scalable digital experience solutions. As an Acquia Bronze Level Community Partner with over a decade of experience, O3 delivers tailored Drupal solutions powered by Acquia-certified experts, ensuring high-performing, scalable digital platforms.</p>\n<h5>Perspective</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/acquia-o3/\">Discover how O3 leverages Acquia&#8217;s powerful platform and our Drupal expertise to create scalable, secure, and high-performing digital experiences</a></p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9377\" src=\"https://live-o3-world.pantheonsite.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-640x640.jpg\" alt=\"VWO + O3 partnership\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" srcset=\"http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-640x640.jpg 640w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-150x150.jpg 150w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-768x768.jpg 768w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-2048x2048.jpg 2048w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-48x48.jpg 48w, http://www.o3world.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/O3-website-imagery_-Perspectives-63-1280x1280.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<h4>VWO</h4>\n<p>Personalizing user experiences can be difficult without advanced tools and expertise in experimentation and personalization. As a certified VWO partner, O3 helps businesses enhance engagement with data-driven experimentation and AI-powered tools like VWO Copilot, delivering smarter customer experiences.</p>\n<h5>Perspective</h5>\n<p><a class=\"underlined-link\" href=\"https://www.o3world.com/perspectives/o3-vwo-partnership-ai-experience-optimization\">Explore how our VWO partnership leverages AI to optimize user experiences and drive measurable results</a></p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
