              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Over two decades of expertise</h4>\n<p>We’ve spent over 20 years designing and building digital solutions that blend innovation with proven practices to drive results.</p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Support beyond delivery</h4>\n<p>Our commitment doesn’t stop at launch. We provide ongoing team and technology support, ensuring long-term success and adaptability.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Solving complex challenges</h4>\n<p>From advanced tools for administrative support to seamless migrations and implementations, we tackle the toughest technical problems.</p>\n"
              },
              {
                "acf_fc_layout": "text",
                "text_editor": "<h4>Innovation + optimization</h4>\n<p>By integrating data with new technologies like AI, we enhance the tools we build to streamline operations, optimize experiences, and empower teams.</p>\n"
              }
            ]
          }
